pgcontext (0.3.0-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Upgrade to the official upstream 0.3.0 clean-install release.
  * Build PostgreSQL 17 and 18 with pgrx and cargo-pgrx 0.19.2.
  * Retire the pgcontext_pgvector companion and historical 0.1/0.2 SQL.
  * Require an explicit export/drop/create/rebuild migration from 0.2.

