pgcontext (0.2.0-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial package for PostgreSQL 17 and 18.
  * Build the upstream locked workspace with cargo-pgrx 0.19.1.
  * Include the upgrade SQL and optional pgcontext_pgvector bridge.
  * Preserve the upstream Apache NOTICE in the package payload.

